sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant S1 as Session 1 (Claude)
    participant S2 as Session 2 (Claude)
    participant S3 as Session 3 (Claude)
    participant S4 as Session 4 (Claude)
    participant S5 as Session 5 (Claude)
    participant File as issue-N.md

    User->>S1: /implement-phase #N
    S1->>File: Implementation Notes
    S1-->>User: done; close VS Code
    User->>S2: /critic-phase #N (fresh context)
    S2->>File: Critic Review
    S2-->>User: status; decide; close
    opt sensitive feature
        User->>S3: /security-phase #N (fresh context)
        S3->>File: Security Review
        S3-->>User: status; decide; close
    end
    User->>S4: /test-phase #N (fresh context)
    S4->>File: Test Results + Manual Test Plan
    S4-->>User: status; decide; close
    User->>S5: /commit-phase #N (fresh context)
    S5->>File: Verification & Commit
    S5-->>User: committed, issue closed
